{
    "title": "CBS News - Live Breaking News",
    "description": "CBS News is your trusted source for breaking U.S. and world news, with local news reporting from our stations in Baltimore, the Bay Area, Boston, Chicago, Dallas-Fort Worth, Denver, Detroit, Los Angeles, Miami, Minneapolis, New York, Philadelphia, Pittsburgh and Sacramento.\r\n\r\nThe CBS News app features:\r\n\r\nLOCAL NEWS COVERAGE\r\nStay updated with live, local news, weather and sports coverage from:\r\n\u2022 WJZ News in Baltimore\r\n\u2022 CBS News Bay Area on KPIX San Francisco\r\n\u2022 WBZ News in Boston\r\n\u2022 CBS 2 News on WBBM Chicago\r\n\u2022 CBS News Colorado on KCNC Denver\r\n\u2022 CBS News Detroit on WWJ\r\n\u2022 KCAL and KCBS in Los Angeles\r\n\u2022 CBS News Miami on WFOR\r\n\u2022 WCCO News Minnesota in Minneapolis\r\n\u2022 CBS News New York on WCBS\r\n\u2022 CBS News Philadelphia on KYW \r\n\u2022 KDKA in Pittsburgh\r\n\u2022 CBS 13 on KOVR Sacramento, featuring Good Day Sacramento on KMAX\r\n\u2022 CBS News Texas on KTVT Dallas-Fort Worth\r\n\r\nLIVE STREAMING NEWS, INCLUDING CBS NEWS 24/7\r\nCBS News 24/7 is the anchored streaming news service from CBS News and Stations, available free to everyone with access to the Internet. The CBS News Streaming Network is your destination for breaking news, live events, and original reporting locally, nationally, and around the globe.\r\n\r\nWe also have 14 live, local streams from CBS Stations in: Baltimore, Maryland; Boston, Massachusetts; Chicago, Illinois; Denver, Colorado; Detroit, Michigan; Los Angeles, California; Miami, Florida; Minneapolis, Minnesota; New York; Philadelphia and Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania; Sacramento and the San Francisco-Bay Area in California, and Dallas-Fort Worth in Texas.\r\n\r\nFULL EPISODES AND CLIPS \r\nWatch full episodes, clips and exclusive interviews from your favorite CBS News shows, including:\r\n\u2022 \u201c60 Minutes\u201d\r\n\u2022 \u201c48 Hours\u201d\r\n\u2022 \u201cCBS Mornings\u201d\r\n\u2022 \u201cCBS Evening News\u201d\r\n\u2022 \u201cCBS Saturday Morning\u201d\r\n\u2022 \u201cCBS Sunday Morning\u201d\r\n\u2022 \u201cFace the Nation\u201d\r\n\u2022 \u201cAmerica Decides\u201d\r\n\u2022 \u201cThe Daily Report with John Dickerson\u201d\r\n\r\nPERSONALIZED PUSH ALERTS\r\nGet alerted to the stories that matter most to you. Customize your push alert settings to get breaking news, local news stories and topics of interest delivered straight to your screen.\r\n\r\nELECTION COVERAGE\r\nCBS News brings you the latest campaign updates, polling and analysis around the presidential election and key House and Senate races.\r\n\r\nPERSONAL FINANCE AND CONSUMER NEWS\r\nWe break down and contextualize the economic headlines of the day and what those mean for your wallet. \r\n\r\nIMMERSIVE DOCUMENTARIES\r\nExplore in-depth documentaries from CBS Reports, examining the critical topics driving the global conversation.\r\n\r\nDownload now and join millions who trust CBS News to keep them informed.\r\n\r\nGet the CBS News app today!\r\n\r\nSUPPORT & FEEDBACK\r\nPlease email us at support.cbsnews@cbsinteractive.com\r\n\r\nADDITIONAL INFORMATION\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://privacy.paramount.com/en/policy?r=www.paramount.com \r\nNote: CBS News and Stations is a division of the CBS Entertainment Group unit of Paramount Global",
    "descriptionHTML": "CBS News is your trusted source for breaking U.S. and world news, with local news reporting from our stations in Baltimore, the Bay Area, Boston, Chicago, Dallas-Fort Worth, Denver, Detroit, Los Angeles, Miami, Minneapolis, New York, Philadelphia, Pittsburgh and Sacramento.<br><br>The CBS News app features:<br><br>LOCAL NEWS COVERAGE<br>Stay updated with live, local news, weather and sports coverage from:<br>\u2022 WJZ News in Baltimore<br>\u2022 CBS News Bay Area on KPIX San Francisco<br>\u2022 WBZ News in Boston<br>\u2022 CBS 2 News on WBBM Chicago<br>\u2022 CBS News Colorado on KCNC Denver<br>\u2022 CBS News Detroit on WWJ<br>\u2022 KCAL and KCBS in Los Angeles<br>\u2022 CBS News Miami on WFOR<br>\u2022 WCCO News Minnesota in Minneapolis<br>\u2022 CBS News New York on WCBS<br>\u2022 CBS News Philadelphia on KYW <br>\u2022 KDKA in Pittsburgh<br>\u2022 CBS 13 on KOVR Sacramento, featuring Good Day Sacramento on KMAX<br>\u2022 CBS News Texas on KTVT Dallas-Fort Worth<br><br>LIVE STREAMING NEWS, INCLUDING CBS NEWS 24/7<br>CBS News 24/7 is the anchored streaming news service from CBS News and Stations, available free to everyone with access to the Internet. The CBS News Streaming Network is your destination for breaking news, live events, and original reporting locally, nationally, and around the globe.<br><br>We also have 14 live, local streams from CBS Stations in: Baltimore, Maryland; Boston, Massachusetts; Chicago, Illinois; Denver, Colorado; Detroit, Michigan; Los Angeles, California; Miami, Florida; Minneapolis, Minnesota; New York; Philadelphia and Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania; Sacramento and the San Francisco-Bay Area in California, and Dallas-Fort Worth in Texas.<br><br>FULL EPISODES AND CLIPS <br>Watch full episodes, clips and exclusive interviews from your favorite CBS News shows, including:<br>\u2022 \u201c60 Minutes\u201d<br>\u2022 \u201c48 Hours\u201d<br>\u2022 \u201cCBS Mornings\u201d<br>\u2022 \u201cCBS Evening News\u201d<br>\u2022 \u201cCBS Saturday Morning\u201d<br>\u2022 \u201cCBS Sunday Morning\u201d<br>\u2022 \u201cFace the Nation\u201d<br>\u2022 \u201cAmerica Decides\u201d<br>\u2022 \u201cThe Daily Report with John Dickerson\u201d<br><br>PERSONALIZED PUSH ALERTS<br>Get alerted to the stories that matter most to you. Customize your push alert settings to get breaking news, local news stories and topics of interest delivered straight to your screen.<br><br>ELECTION COVERAGE<br>CBS News brings you the latest campaign updates, polling and analysis around the presidential election and key House and Senate races.<br><br>PERSONAL FINANCE AND CONSUMER NEWS<br>We break down and contextualize the economic headlines of the day and what those mean for your wallet. <br><br>IMMERSIVE DOCUMENTARIES<br>Explore in-depth documentaries from CBS Reports, examining the critical topics driving the global conversation.<br><br>Download now and join millions who trust CBS News to keep them informed.<br><br>Get the CBS News app today!<br><br>SUPPORT &amp; FEEDBACK<br>Please email us at support.cbsnews@cbsinteractive.com<br><br>ADDITIONAL INFORMATION<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://privacy.paramount.com/en/policy?r=www.paramount.com <br>Note: CBS News and Stations is a division of the CBS Entertainment Group unit of Paramount Global",
